### Alle Stationen (JSON)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Alle Stationen (XML)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123
Accept: application/xml

### Filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations?river=Donau&isActive=true
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Einzelne Station
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations/ST-001
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Aktueller Messwert (XML)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations/ST-003/measurements/latest
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123
Accept: application/xml

### Historische Messwerte
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations/ST-003/measurements?limit=10&warningLevel=NORMAL
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Statistik
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations/ST-003/statistics
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Warnungen
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Fehler: unbekannte Station (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations/ST-999
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Fehler: from nach to (400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations/ST-001/measurements?from=2026-05-01T12:00:00Z&to=2026-05-01T08:00:00Z
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123

### Fehler: Format nicht unterstuetzt (406)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations
Authorization: Basic viewer viewer123
Accept: text/csv

### Fehler: ohne Login (401)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stations
